#Task Specification - Task
betterquesting.quest.ahCSSUdvNkOqrpz07SDAlQ.name=Welcome to Talos!
betterquesting.quest.ahCSSUdvNkOqrpz07SDAlQ.desc=Welcome to Planet Talos!%n%nWhat? You’re not here yet? All you need is a Tier 4 Rocket to fly over! Planet Talos is located in the upper-right region of the solar system, so it won’t be hard to find.%n%nYou’re going to love it here. We have plenty of brand-new minerals and industrial machines waiting for you to craft. Now, let’s search this land for Orundum ore veins scattered across the continent.%n%nBy mining those black, glass-like ore blocks, you can obtain Orundum ore, which is the foundation of all our industry here!%n%nHave fun!
betterquesting.quest.2jkE9GM8NlOsrYkogMmzdw.name=Your First Ark Machine!
betterquesting.quest.2jkE9GM8NlOsrYkogMmzdw.desc=This machine will see you through the early stages of the game! You don’t really want to run all over Planet Talos and still barely dig up any Orundum Ore, right?%n%nI hope you’ve prepared enough Originite Prime to build it! Before that, I recommend checking the quest line on the left and crafting your very first piece of Originite Prime!

