EOHB_ArknightsItem_BaiMaChun_02=A product made from Loxic Kohl after fine processing. It was named after the company that discovered its
EOHB_ArknightsItem_BaiMaChun_03=production method. Experiments show that it tends to
EOHB_ArknightsItem_BaiMaChun_04=transform to a higher structure in abnormal environments.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_BanZiRanRongJi_00=An active solvent with excellent physical characteristics, and good
EOHB_ArknightsItem_BanZiRanRongJi_01=resistance to acids and bases. Can be used in a variety of upgrades.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_BanZiRanRongJi_02=The product of a traditional solvent undergoing a modernization
EOHB_ArknightsItem_BanZiRanRongJi_03=process, it demonstrates remarkably enhanced properties.
