EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChiHeJinKuai_01=the electronics industry. Can be used for a variety of upgrades.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChiHeJinKuai_02=A product derived from further processing of incandescent alloy. After
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChiHeJinKuai_03=complicated industrial processing, the stability of its solid-liquid hybridization
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChiHeJinKuai_04=state at certain temperatures has been preserved. As a result, it has an
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChiHeJinKuai_05=irreplaceable role in product development in the cutting-edge electronics industry.
