EOHB_ArknightsItem_QingMengKuang_00=A metal ore used for metallurgy. Can be used for a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QingMengKuang_01=variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QingMengKuang_02=A metal that is used to produce a catalyst
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QingMengKuang_03=widely used in industries. As the reprocessing
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QingMengKuang_04=is complicated, accidents caused by nonstandard techniques do happen from time to time.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QuanXinZhuangZhi_00=A brand new mechanical device captured from Reunion. Can be used
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QuanXinZhuangZhi_01=for a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QuanXinZhuangZhi_02=A set of brand new devices. By reproducing the
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QuanXinZhuangZhi_03=structure of devices of the same type, the lack of space
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QuanXinZhuangZhi_04=around the motherboard has been solved. The energy consumption, of course, has also become higher.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_12_00=A sensitive mineral with high conductivity. Can be used for
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_12_01=a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_12_02=A mineral whose natural form is a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_12_03=complicated polyhedron. Its value
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_12_04=for Originium Arts was known long before its industrial value.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_24_00=A highly sensitive mineral with
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_24_01=outstanding conductivity. Can be
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_24_02=used for a variety of upgrades and the synthesis of D32 Steel.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_24_03=A mineral whose natural form is a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_24_04=complicated polyhedron. Found in 1024, it
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_24_05=shows great industrial value that other
EOHB_ArknightsItem_RMA70_24_06=minerals used for Originium Arts lack.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanShuiMengKuang_00=A metal ore used for metallurgy. Can be used for a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanShuiMengKuang_01=variety of upgrades and the synthesis of D32 Steel.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanShuiMengKuang_02=A precious metal which few companies are willing to use to produce industrial catalysts. The catalyst made from it, however, has an extremely
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanShuiMengKuang_03=long service life. It can be used repeatedly and even stripped and recycled,
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanShuiMengKuang_04=but the complicated processes have forced many companies to give up.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShaoJieHeNingJing_00=A product of modern technology that requires the ultimate in industrial craft. Used in advanced strengthening projects.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShaoJieHeNingJing_01=A material that possesses a molecular recognitive capacity under specific high-temperature conditions. Can selectively adsorb Originium when used as a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShaoJieHeNingJing_02=reagent, allowing for precise handling of Originium materials, lower Originium
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShaoJieHeNingJing_03=device energy consumption, and the opening of further new possibilities.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShouXingQuGuangTi_00=A specialized material that displays useful optical qualities
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShouXingQuGuangTi_01=and other physical traits. Can be used for high level upgrades.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShouXingQuGuangTi_02=An optical material that boasts both physical
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShouXingQuGuangTi_03=durability and astonishing Originium Arts resistance,
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShouXingQuGuangTi_04=currently used in studies regarding optical protection. Other uses are still being tested.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangJiNaMiPian_00=The brainchild of modern science and industry. Can be used for high level upgrades.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangJiNaMiPian_01=A device that is sensitive to Originium within a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangJiNaMiPian_02=certain range. It can significantly improve the
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangJiNaMiPian_03=sensitivity of nearby weapons and equipment to
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangJiNaMiPian_04=Originium, making them near vessels for Originium Arts.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangTong_00=A very small amount of industrial organic compound. Can be used
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangTong_01=for a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangTong_02=A very small amount of Diketon. After
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangTong_03=reprocessing, Engineer Operators use
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangTong_04=solidification during chemical combination
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ShuangTong_05=to bond other stable structures.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_Tan_00=A carbon stick used for the facility development of Rhodes Island.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_Tan_01=One of the necessary industrial materials, it
EOHB_ArknightsItem_Tan_02=can be used to produce a variety of polymers.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_Tang_00=A small amount of sugar produced by assembly line. Can be used
EOHB_ArknightsItem_Tang_01=for a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_Tang_02=A more expensive sugar made from natural
EOHB_ArknightsItem_Tang_03=materials. Ahh, this taste... will
EOHB_ArknightsItem_Tang_04=surely put one in a great mood. However, it's not for casual snacking.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangJuKuai_00=A large amount of sugar produced by assembly line. Can be used
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangJuKuai_01=for a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangJuKuai_02=A nice, finely processed sugar lump
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangJuKuai_03=commonly used for potion production. Do
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangJuKuai_04=not taste test it! This is not food and is not to be sold as food! EVER!
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangZu_00=A decent amount of sugar produced by assembly line. Can be used
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangZu_01=for a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangZu_02=A calorie-rich sugar pack that's highly sought
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangZu_03=after. Its weight never seems to meet the standards
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TangZu_04=set for chemical manufacturing. The production line employees may have something to do with it.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TanSu_00=A carbon brick used for the facility development of Rhodes Island.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TanSu_01=Light and highly pure, it possesses excellent workability,
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TanSu_02=and is instrumental to the success of our operations.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TanSuZu_00=A pack of carbon bricks used for the facility development of Rhodes Island.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TanSuZu_01=A large number of carbon bricks. Every one of them has a burning soul for modern industry.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TiChunYuanYan_00=A refined matter produced with Orirock Cluster. Can be used for a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TiChunYuanYan_01=variety of upgrades and the synthesis of Polymerization Preparation.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TiChunYuanYan_02=This Orirock looks different from the raw material after the
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TiChunYuanYan_03=refinement process. It costs much more than other processing
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TiChunYuanYan_04=methods. Anyone who has seen the smooth cutting surface will be
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TiChunYuanYan_05=amazed. That must be the charm of combining nature with industry.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJi_00=A small amount of industrial organic compound. Can be used
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJi_01=for a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJi_02=A small amount of Polyketon preparation produced through a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJi_03=special process. Its closed molecular structure has changed
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJi_04=much complicated processing into simple chemical reactions.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJi_05=Of course, certain technical support is still needed.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJiZu_00=A modest amount of industrial organic compound. Can be used
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJiZu_01=for a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJiZu_02=A modest amount of Aketon preparation produced through
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJiZu_03=further dehydrocarbon processing. The preparation reacts
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJiZu_04=with the non-oxygen molecules in the air, so Engineer
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongNingJiZu_05=Operators must be careful during processing to avoid waste.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongZhenLie_00=A large amount of industrial organic compound. Can be used for a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongZhenLie_01=variety of upgrades and the synthesis of Polymerization Preparation.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongZhenLie_02=A large amount of unstable Keton preparation. As one of the advanced industrial materials,
EOHB_ArknightsItem_TongZhenLie_03=it is closely monitored by our Engineer Operators. Please be careful when handling.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_WuShuiYanMoShi_00=An advanced grindstone used in the finish machining of weapon parts.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_WuShuiYanMoShi_01=Can be used for a variety of upgrades
EOHB_ArknightsItem_WuShuiYanMoShi_02=and the synthesis of D32 Steel.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_WuShuiYanMoShi_03=Compared to normal Grindstone, this tool has an even
EOHB_ArknightsItem_WuShuiYanMoShi_04=more stable structure. It is highly non-reactive.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YanMoShi_00=A grindstone used to process weapon parts. Can be used for
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YanMoShi_01=a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YanMoShi_02=An important tool in component
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YanMoShi_03=processing. It has stable
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YanMoShi_04=properties, and will never explode, powderize, or crack.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaGaoNengQiTi_00=Liquefied gas stored in specially made metal containers. Can be used in a variety
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaGaoNengQiTi_01=of strengthening situations, and is often a material for Factory Station synthesis.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaGaoNengQiTi_02=A highly active, highly flammable gas product. It burns at extremely high temperatures and can
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaGaoNengQiTi_03=melt most metal materials, making it widely used
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaGaoNengQiTi_04=in industrial welding and catalytic reactions.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaMiXiJuTi_00=An organic compound obtained through a complex synthesis
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaMiXiJuTi_01=process. Can be used in a variety of strengthening situations.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaMiXiJuTi_02=An ether preparation obtained by passivating ketone
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaMiXiJuTi_03=preparations. It is relatively stable and does
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YeHuaMiXiJuTi_04=not react with active metal materials, making it widely used in various industrial processes.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTie_00=A rare industrial material. Can be used for a variety
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTie_01=of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTie_02=In a small number of inerting processes, Oriron Shards may have phase changed and polymerized
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTie_03=into Oriron. It is generally thought that Oriron
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTie_04=is relatively stable when it reaches this level.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieKuai_00=An expensive industrial material. Can be used for a variety
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieKuai_01=of upgrades and the synthesis of Polymerization Preparation.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieKuai_02=An Oriron block fused with multiple Oriron Clusters under extremely harsh conditions. As the
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieKuai_03=most stable and rarest form of Oriron, it can be
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieKuai_04=used in all manners of industrial production.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieSuiPian_00=A common industrial material. Can be used for a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieSuiPian_01=variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieSuiPian_02=A byproduct of massive metal processing.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieSuiPian_03=Its high plasticity and oxidation
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieSuiPian_04=resistance make it a common material of smelting and phased processing.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieZu_00=A precious industrial material. Can be used for a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieZu_01=variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieZu_02=During the processing, influenced by very few unartificial factors, multiple Orirons may
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YiTieZu_03=merge into this form by chance. Its hardness has decreased but its purity has increased.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YuanShiSuiPian_00=An Originium shard collected from polluted regions. Can be used to produce Orundum.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YuanShiSuiPian_01=An Originium shard collected from heavily contaminated
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YuanShiSuiPian_02=regions. Anyone who touches it has a high chance to get
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YuanShiSuiPian_03=infected and even mutate. Therefore, it is a hazardous
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YuanShiSuiPian_04=material as indicated in the Columbia CDC toxicity database.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YuanYan_00=A rock mined from the ground. Can be used for a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YuanYan_01=variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YuanYan_02=Rich in organics, it is commonly seen in regions where Originium has
EOHB_ArknightsItem_YuanYan_03=completely volatilized. Compared to Originium, it is easier to exploit.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhiYuanLiao_00=Ester used in industrial production. Can be used for a
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhiYuanLiao_01=variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhiYuanLiao_02=One of the most important materials in modern industry. Its appearance has lead to the development
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhiYuanLiao_03=of many modern products. This one, of course, is
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhiYuanLiao_04=only a raw material that has practical application.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhongXiangWeiDuiYingTi_00=A product of cutting-edge research on luminescent materials. Can be used for high level upgrades.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhongXiangWeiDuiYingTi_01=A new material still in the experimental stage. Not
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhongXiangWeiDuiYingTi_02=only can it output large amounts of energy, but it can
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhongXiangWeiDuiYingTi_03=also adapt to Originium Arts. This may indicate the
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhongXiangWeiDuiYingTi_04=future development of this optically protective material.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuangZhi_00=An ordinary mechanical device captured from Reunion. Can be used
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuangZhi_01=for a variety of upgrades and for production in the Factory.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuangZhi_02=A set of devices that are relatively complete
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuangZhi_03=with numerous valuable components. To make
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuangZhi_04=it portable and practical, almost every bit of space around the motherboard is in use.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuanZhiYanJuKuai_00=A compound crystal mass that has undergone high-tolerance refinement. Used in a variety
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuanZhiYanJuKuai_01=of strengthening projects, and is a common material in synthetic items at factories.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuanZhiYanJuKuai_02=A stable crystalline body, manufactured as a crystal blend within saturated
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuanZhiYanJuKuai_03=solutions. Can provide materials with a diverse array of capabilities.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QiYiWuZhi_00=Strange matter captured from the star, completely different in nature from matter in the material world.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_QiYiWuZhi_01=Seems it can be used to improve machine performance.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_D96GangYangPin4_00=A novel and artificial alloy of D32 steel and D64 steel that
EOHB_ArknightsItem_D96GangYangPin4_01=cannot exist naturally. D96 steel has inherited the excellent
EOHB_ArknightsItem_D96GangYangPin4_02=strength and Arts conduction properties of its constituents.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_D96GangYangPin4_03=It also features better performance in areas with unstable
EOHB_ArknightsItem_D96GangYangPin4_04=Originium activities. The material is still being experimented
EOHB_ArknightsItem_D96GangYangPin4_05=upon, with Sample 4 offering the best cost performance index.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanXiangNaMiPian_00=A device that is extremely sensitive to ambient Originium.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanXiangNaMiPian_01=It can boost Originium sensitivity of all weapons and devices
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanXiangNaMiPian_02=within a significantly large area. The Triphasic Nanoflake is
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanXiangNaMiPian_03=a key component for containing and storing the Arts, and
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanXiangNaMiPian_04=offers better performance in non-realspace environments
EOHB_ArknightsItem_SanXiangNaMiPian_05=compared to the older Bipolar Nanoflakes.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_KuaiZiLinJianJingGe_00=An ion trap that might be leveraging its innate Aether properties.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_KuaiZiLinJianJingGe_01=The lattice ignores temporal factors and is capable of detecting
EOHB_ArknightsItem_KuaiZiLinJianJingGe_02=and screening naturally occurring tachyon beams in realspace.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_KuaiZiLinJianJingGe_03=Since the people of Talos-II are still incapable of activating
EOHB_ArknightsItem_KuaiZiLinJianJingGe_04=and firing tachyons, the lattice is thus essential for any
EOHB_ArknightsItem_KuaiZiLinJianJingGe_05=experiments involving random outcome solidification.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_XiangXianNiHeYe_00=A hypothetical condensed matter in fluid state. Though it
EOHB_ArknightsItem_XiangXianNiHeYe_01=could be synthesized and the optical properties of the
EOHB_ArknightsItem_XiangXianNiHeYe_02=resulting materials could be observed, the actual structure
EOHB_ArknightsItem_XiangXianNiHeYe_03=and state of the fluid have yet to be successfully measured.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_XiangXianNiHeYe_04=The fluid effectively suppresses Originium sublimation in all
EOHB_ArknightsItem_XiangXianNiHeYe_05=Depths that could be artificially created, making it an
EOHB_ArknightsItem_XiangXianNiHeYe_06=extraordinarily effective filler.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChaoJuHuiYingGuan_00=A synthetic item for detecting and verifying various field
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChaoJuHuiYingGuan_01=forces and actions at a distance. The tube usually comprises
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChaoJuHuiYingGuan_02=a time crystal sealed in a static vessel, and uses observable
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChaoJuHuiYingGuan_03=regression properties of the photons to achieve its purpose.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChaoJuHuiYingGuan_04=Though typically stable, users should avoid breaking the vessel
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ChaoJuHuiYingGuan_05=and stay out of areas between a pair of linked tubes.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuanZhiYanZu_00=A compound crystallization that has undergone low-tolerance refinement. Can be used in a variety of strengthening projects.
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuanZhiYanZu_01=The surface of this material has mutable characteristics, realizing results that were originally
EOHB_ArknightsItem_ZhuanZhiYanZu_02=nearly impossible. CAUTION: industrial salt is not to be eaten under any circumstances.
