eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.0=Unlocks the base functionality of the Dyson Core (active by default).
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.1=Manufacturing round time: 30s → 15s.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.2=Manufacturing round time: 15s → 10s.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.3=Manufacturing round time: 10s → 5s.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.4=Manufacturing base parallel: 64 → 128.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.5=Manufacturing base parallel: 128 → 512; each round has a 20% chance to produce 100~200x the recipe output.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.6=Launch round time: 10s → 5s.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.7=Launch round time: 5s → 2s.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.8=Launch batch per round: 16 → 64.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.9=Launch batch per round: 64 → 128.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.10=Unlocks dual-track launch: clouds and frames launch together in the same round, each up to its own batch (max 128 each).
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.11=Cloud-to-paste settlement runs twice a day instead of once; still requires a team core to be online.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.12=Daily cloud drop reduced from 10~64 to 8~48.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.13=50% of daily dropped clouds are recovered as cloud components for the owner of the working receiver module (personal asset).
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.14=Unlocks the EU / Orundum percentage split (0-100) of the receiver module.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.15=Unlocks the Mass Launch Module: one fixed 60s round launches all of the owner's cloud/frame components at once.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.text.16=Once unlocked, the core automatically ejects Strange Matter into the output bus every second (accumulates in the core while no bus is attached).
eohb.dyson.upgrade.lore.0=The origin of the Dyson megastructure.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.lore.1=Optimizes manufacturing cadence.
eohb.dyson.upgrade.lore.2=Further optimizes manufacturing cadence.
